<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>nathonks</Major>
    <Description>Macro by nathonks
FOV any, Sensitivity any, DPI any

This is for Rust ONLY and easy to use, you just have to bind the script to a key then you are auto clicking.
This macro just auto clicks for you if you are too lazy to farm or you can use it for an anti-afk</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 86400000 min</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rust</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>